<!--
  Omni_Builder mark.

  Three stacked layers over a rising chevron: Core, plugin runtime and artifact.
  A vector drawable rather than a set of density-specific bitmaps, so the icon is
  a reviewable text file and the repository carries no opaque binary assets.
-->
